{'symbol': 'HPE', 'date': '2023-02-21 04:00:00', 'title': 'OL GROUPE SELECTS HPE GREENLAKE TO SUPPORT ITS ENERGY EFFICIENCY PLAN AND IMPROVE THE VISITOR AND FAN EXPERIENCE', 'text': 'PARIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HEWLETT PACKARD ENTERPRISE (NYSE: HPE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT OL GROUPE HAS SELECTED THE HPE GREENLAKE EDGE-TO-CLOUD PLATFORM TO MODERNIZE ITS ENTIRE ON-PREMISES INFRASTRUCTURE. THE HPE SOLUTION ENABLES OL GROUPE TO INCREASE ITS AGILITY TO DEPLOY IT RESOURCES, REDUCE ITS ENVIRONMENTAL FOOTPRINT AND ACCELERATE THE DEVELOPMENT OF ITS NEW ENTERTAINMENT OFFERINGS TO ITS MILLIONS OF FANS WORLDWIDE.'}